# ReXGlue SDK changes for WWE 2K14 (session27): 7412a803920f..8794393499be on wwe2k14-local
# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  8794393 Session 27 (review): present_effect fsr2 / fsr3 fall back to FSR 1 without the FidelityFX runtime
#  2946e71 Session 27: FSR 1 (EASU + RCAS) and CAS always built (in-tree precompiled shaders; REX_HAS_FIDELITYFX_SDK defined in presenter.h); FSR 2 / 3 still need the FidelityFX SDK
#  807c2fa Session 27: DLSS reset hold after a camera cut (gpu_dlss_reset_hold_frames, default 1 = as before): the picture cuts 2-3 frames after the camera
#  e0e9059 Session 27: start SDL audio in SDLAudioSystem::Setup (UI thread), not Initialize (the Audio Worker thread, which still raced the UI thread's pumps)
#  c2fb557 Session 27: start SDL audio on the UI thread at setup (audio_sdl_init_on_ui_thread, default true): fixes the boot race in SDL_UpdateAudio (0xC0000264)

